  (1) COMPUTED: an enumeration of <=4-op dimensionless expressions over a 12-symbol alphabet
      (18947031 distinct values), with in-band counts by complexity.
  (2) NUMBERS: at k=3, a fraction 0.108 of O(1) natural numbers fall in the 2 sigma kappa band; at
